        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a0be5ec95fd9457ea226345b6cf947c9",
      "statement": "CORS is configured in src/cors.ts with a default allowlist covering production dashboards (https://digiquant.io, https://digithings.ai) and local development ports (localhost:3000, :3100, :3101 and their 127.0.0.1 equivalents). The allowlist is fully overridable via the DASHBOARD_API_ALLOWED_ORIGINS env var; it is not merged with defaults.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/dashboard-api/src/cors.ts#L15-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a4a40b4ad34fa3e0ddb73bb2a1b0ddd01e9112a9324e763905d4367f5e35a3a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7e2392a1b89640cba8b1c6895984ea93",
      "statement": "CI/CD deployment is handled by .github/workflows/deploy-dashboard-api.yml: it triggers on path-filtered push to develop/main (apps/dashboard-api/** or the workflow file itself) and workflow_dispatch, runs npm ci → test → typecheck, then deploys via cloudflare/wrangler-action@v3 with SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY synced from GitHub secrets into worker secrets.",
      "evidence": [
