        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cff1c18cadba499ea001a823df73d76a",
      "statement": "MCP tools never reimplement route logic: each `tools/call` builds a synthetic GET Request for the matching route path and dispatches it through the worker's own `routeGet()` handler, so the JSON-RPC response is byte-identical to the HTTP response from the same builder functions.",
