    {
      "id": "claim_c21461e0879047908cdc9e1494e71f19",
      "statement": "Market data reads (closes, tickers, benchmark history) follow a soft-failure rule: when MARKET_DATA_URL is unset or the market API returns non-OK, `loadMarketClosesMap()` returns an empty map and builders flow the honest-empty path (e.g., `marks: \"unavailable\"` in provenance). Market closes never fall back to Supabase.",
